eep, rest and personal hygiene. Particular attention must be paid to the health of the settlers. Timely treatment and care for the injured and sick will ensure their survival and well-being.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have dozens of unique game resources at your disposal, and mineral deposits will be scattered unevenly across the planets. Create and optimize a logistics network with an efficient shuttle system that will transport cargo and personnel between colonies and spaceports. Conclude contracts and trade with all game nations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Harsh conditions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space is a hostile place for humans: the temperature varies greatly depending on the time of day and time of year and depends on the location of the colony on the planet, the presence of an atmosphere and the distance to the Sun. The radiation background varies on different celestial bodies and increases during solar flares. Meteor showers pose a serious threat to colonies and orbital stations. And on planets with an active atmosphere, storms and calms periodically occur, disrupting logistics and affecting electricity generation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Research and technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This path will not be easy, but science and technology will help to overcome all difficulties. Produce new high-tech resources to create increasingly complex equipment and better building structures. Use powerful engines and wireless power transmission to colonize the most remote corners of the Solar System. Explore space farming and cuisine for a varied diet and greater comfort for astronauts, and space tourism for additional income. And also robots, clones, force fields and much more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Solar System awaits you in Solargene!</strong></p>","developers":["Alexander Semenov"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28